  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="32.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 32.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="32.1" corresp="#wit-g-a">⁊ æt ðam oðran cyrre ne si þær nan oðer bót butan þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> heafod.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="32.1" corresp="#wit-a">An[d] æt þam oðrum cerre ne sy þær nan bot buton þæt heafod.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="32.1" corresp="#wit-q">Secunda uice nulla sit emendatio nisi caput.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="32.1" corresp="#wit-b">⁊ æt ðam oðran cyrran ne sy ðær nan bot buton þæt heafod.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And æt þam oðran cyrre ne si þær nan oðer bot butan þæt heafod.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und beim zweiten Male gebe es da keine andere Busse als den Kopf.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And the second time let there be no other compensation there than the head.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">And on the second occasion he shall not be able to make any amends except by his head.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">And on the second occasion, there is to be no compensation except his head.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a">And on the next occasion he shall not be able to make compensation except with his head.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="336"><ref target="clause:IAtr_2-1">I Atr 2.1</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 2, 1</note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares I Atr 2.1.</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">oðer: omitted B</note>
      </div>
    </body>
